# Git co-author: djmango

When you **create or amend** git commits in this repository, append this trailer to the commit message body (after the subject and blank line):

```
Co-authored-by: Sulaiman Khan Ghori <28496988+djmango@users.noreply.github.com>
```

Rules:

- Do not duplicate the trailer if it is already present.
- Keep the existing subject line and body unchanged; only add the trailer.
- Use this for commits made by Cursor Agent or cloud agents unless the user explicitly opts out.
